00:00:28.150 --> 00:00:30.560
survival stories in human history.

00:00:31.119 --> 00:00:33.640
It's the story of a plane crash in the

00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:37.080
Andes mountains in 1972, a group of

00:00:37.090 --> 00:00:40.029
young Uruguayan rugby players, some

00:00:40.029 --> 00:00:42.370
of the harshest conditions imaginable,

00:00:42.670 --> 00:00:45.010
and one of the most agonising moral

00:00:45.010 --> 00:00:47.140
dilemmas that any group of people

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:49.280
has ever been forced to face.

00:00:49.830 --> 00:00:52.090
It's a story I'm particularly excited

00:00:52.090 --> 00:00:53.969
to tell, because there is some

00:00:53.969 --> 00:00:56.500
backstory behind today's episode.

