A few weeks ago, I got an email out of the

00:01:00.290 --> 00:01:03.339
blue from a Spanish teacher named Javier.

00:01:03.930 --> 00:01:06.530
He told me that he was a regular listener

00:01:06.720 --> 00:01:08.770
