00:01:15.170 --> 00:01:17.179
telling similar kinds of stories.

00:01:17.539 --> 00:01:19.720
It's called Radio ELE, and

00:01:19.770 --> 00:01:21.550
he is doing a great job.

00:01:23.060 --> 00:01:25.030
He also made a suggestion.

00:01:25.340 --> 00:01:27.779
He offered to translate one of his

00:01:27.820 --> 00:01:30.660
episodes into English, for it to appear

00:01:31.060 --> 00:01:32.739
here on English Learning for Curious

00:01:32.740 --> 00:01:35.479
Minds, and he suggested this one.

00:01:36.100 --> 00:01:38.970
I've made some stylistic changes, but

